# Project Images

This directory contains the images used to document the ECG Heartbeat Monitoring System.

## Contents

- `ecg-circuit-diagram.png` — Circuit diagram of the Arduino UNO and AD8232 interface.
- `ecg-hardware-setup.jpeg` — Photograph of the assembled hardware prototype.
- `ECG_Waveform.png` — ECG waveform visualization.
- `IMG-20250219-WA0012.jpg` — Additional project photograph.

These images are referenced by the main repository README for hardware and project documentation.
